<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>LookingTheShark - Network Analysis Report</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; margin: 40px auto; max-width: 900px; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        h1, h2, h3 { color: #2c3e50; }
        .header { background-color: #f8f9fa; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 5px solid #00bcd4; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .finding { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-radius: 5px; }
        .sev-critical { border-left: 5px solid #f44336; background-color: #ffebee; }
        .sev-high { border-left: 5px solid #ff9800; background-color: #fff3e0; }
        .sev-medium { border-left: 5px solid #ffeb3b; background-color: #fffde7; }
        .sev-low { border-left: 5px solid #4caf50; background-color: #e8f5e9; }
        .sev-info { border-left: 5px solid #2196f3; background-color: #e3f2fd; }
        .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 3px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 0.85em; color: white; margin-right: 10px; }
        .bg-critical { background-color: #f44336; }
        .bg-high { background-color: #ff9800; }
        .bg-medium { background-color: #fbc02d; color: black; }
        .bg-low { background-color: #4caf50; }
        .bg-info { background-color: #2196f3; }
        code { background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 3px; font-family: monospace; }
        .evidence { background-color: #272822; color: #f8f8f2; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.9em; overflow-x: auto; }
        .footer { margin-top: 50px; font-size: 0.8em; color: #777; text-align: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="header">
        <h1>🦈 LookingTheShark</h1>
        <h2>Network Forensics Analysis Report</h2>
        <p><strong>Capture Analysed:</strong> <code>{{ capture.name }}</code></p>
        <p><strong>Packets:</strong> {{ capture.packets }} | <strong>Duration:</strong> {{ capture.duration }}</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Executive Summary</h2>
    <p>Network capture analysis revealed <strong>{{ findings|length }}</strong> security finding(s). Manual review of events marked Critical or High is required to confirm or rule out incidents.</p>

    <h2>Findings Detail</h2>

    {% for f in findings %}
    <div class="finding sev-{{ f.severity }}">
        <h3><span class="badge bg-{{ f.severity }}">{{ f.severity|upper }}</span> {{ f.title }}</h3>
        <p><strong>Description:</strong> {{ f.description }}</p>

        <p><strong>Evidence:</strong></p>
        <div class="evidence">{{ f.evidence }}</div>

        <ul style="margin-top: 15px;">
            <li><strong>Detecting Module:</strong> <code>{{ f.module }}</code></li>
            {% if f.mitre_name %}
            <li><strong>MITRE ATT&CK Technique:</strong> {{ f.mitre_name }}</li>
            {% endif %}
            <li><strong>Analyser Confidence:</strong> {{ f.confidence|capitalize }}</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <p><em>No security anomalies found in this capture.</em></p>
    {% endfor %}

    <div class="footer">
        Automatically generated by LookingTheShark v1.0
    </div>
</body>
</html>
